{"title": "Death Curse", "pageid": 2103, "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>Also known as Blood Curse. One of the most powerfull spells available to initiates of the <a href=\"/wiki/The_Pattern\" title=\"The Pattern\">Pattern</a>. The death curse surprisingly does not require any special training. During the height of physical suffering, usually before death, a son or daughter of <a href=\"/wiki/Amber\" title=\"Amber\">Amber</a> can lay this spell on any being. Although the effect is usually indirect it is practically impossible to overcome. <a href=\"/wiki/Corwin\" title=\"Corwin\">Corwin</a> uses a death curse on <a href=\"/wiki/Eric\" title=\"Eric\">Eric</a> and subsequently, Eric uses a death curse against the forces of Chaos that assault Amber.<a href=\"/wiki/User:Orange_shadow\" title=\"User:Orange shadow\">Orange shadow</a> 23:43, August 7, 2010 (UTC)\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260501231336\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.005 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.007 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 1/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.1_prod_princeofamber:pcache:idhash:2103-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260501231336 and revision id 4103. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>", "sections": [], "links": [{"ns": 2, "title": "User:Orange shadow", "exists": true}, {"ns": 0, "title": "Amber", "exists": true}, {"ns": 0, "title": "Corwin", "exists": true}, {"ns": 0, "title": "Eric", "exists": true}, {"ns": 0, "title": "The Pattern", "exists": tr